  "_note": [
    "Board 775:4241. The loading screen is module state in `cmsSync` (one hydrate",
    "per session), so ContentTab takes an injected `hydrationStatus` and the probe",
    "mounts the whole tab — the skeleton is the panel's OWN structure, not a",
    "stand-in list, so it has to be measured inside the panel that draws it.",
    "",
    "BOARD won once: the two section bands drew line-height 16 and the shared",
    "SectionHeader leaves it to the face (`normal`). `SECTION_H` — the Content-only",
    "override that already raises the band from the shared 28 to 32 — now carries",
    "`tw:leading-4` too. Nothing outside Content reads SECTION_H, so the shared",
    "primitive is untouched.",
    "",
    "A data-testid was added to the skeleton row's GLYPH block; the row and the",
    "label bar already had one.",
    "",
    "NOT anchored: 776:4099 (the DATA band's text node) — SectionHeader puts the",
    "label in an inner <span> and the type is declared on the band itself, which",
    "776:4098 already anchors. The two hotspot/* nodes are prototype wiring.",
    "",
    "CONTRAST: 2 recorded failures, both `Collections`/`Data` at ink-muted on",
    "bg-subtle = 4.39. Pre-existing and specified BY this board; it is the",
    "39-instance token defect in docs/design-jobs/FIGMA-TO-CODE/CONTRAST-INK-MUTED.md,",
